# @app-design-system/<%= name %>

<%= description %>

## Usage

```html
<brk-<%= name %> size="md">Content</brk-<%= name %>>
```

- `size`: `'sm' | 'md' | 'lg'` (default `'md'`)

Colors come from `@app-design-system/theme-angular-material`'s `--mat-sys-*`
variables and spacing/radius/type from `@app-design-system/tokens`, so this
re-themes with `setTheme()` like every other component.

## Testing

`<%= className %>Harness` (Angular CDK `ComponentHarness`) is exported for
consumers to test against instead of querying host DOM directly.

Run `nx test <%= name %>` to execute the unit tests.
